  patches/hybris-boot/   derived from mer-hybris/hybris-boot (GPL-2.0)
  patches/droid-configs-device/
                         four changes to mer-hybris/droid-hal-configs
  droid-configs/         excluding droid-configs-device/, see below
  scripts/
  docs/

