Third-party code included here
------------------------------

droid-configs/droid-configs-device/ is a vendored copy of

    https://github.com/mer-hybris/droid-hal-configs

at upstream commit a9b3995 (2026-07-02), with the four changes in
patches/droid-configs-device/ applied on top. Vendoring this tree is how the
Sailfish OS HADK assembles a device configuration package -- upstream it is a
git submodule. It is included directly here so this repository is a complete,
self-contained snapshot of what built the released image.

Upstream ships no license file, so this repository asserts no license terms
over that subdirectory. It is redistributed as received and its copyright
remains with its respective authors. The GPL-2.0 grant above covers only the
four patches applied to it, not the upstream files themselves.

If you hold copyright on anything in that subdirectory and want it removed or
relicensed, open an issue and it will be handled.
